   "id": "lead-1",
   "section": "(lead)",
   "text": "Ilyās ibn al-Qassīs Ḥannā al-Mawṣilī, (الياس ابن حنا القوشي الموصلي ) also known as Elias of Babylon was a late 17th century Syriac Christian priest and author.",
