  {
   "id": "lead-4",
   "section": "(lead)",
   "text": "He is known for his accounts of his travels in Western Europe and the Spanish colonies in the New World, which is considered to be the oldest record in Arabic-language literature devoted to the Americas.",
   "words": 36,
   "authors": [
